name koma-script-sfs
category Package
revision 26137
shortdesc Koma-script letter class option for Finnish
relocated 1
longdesc A koma-script parameter set for letters on A4 paper, complying
longdesc with Finnish standards SFS 2486, 2487 and 2488; suitable for
longdesc window envelopes with window on the left size in the sizes C5,
longdesc C65, E5 and E65 (although, because the address window is
longdesc smaller, for sizes E5 and E65 the address may not fit within
longdesc the window, but ordinary 3-line address should fit).
runfiles size=2
